  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rehab. bridges, Mitch</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Rehab. broar, Mitch</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reconstruction of bridges all over Honduras that got destroyed becauseof the big amounts of water running in the rivers due to the hurrican Mitch that hit C-A in november 1998. 14 bridges are identified for swedish assistance both in rural and urban areas. The bridges are partof important roads for transportation in the region.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&#xC5;teruppbyggnad av broar utspridda &#xF6;ver Honduras som rasat pga de storavattenmassor i floderna som orsakades av orkanen Mitch som drabbade regionen i november 1998. 14 objekt &#xE4;r identifierade f&#xF6;r svensk finansiering b&#xE5;de p&#xE5; landsbygd och i st&#xF6;rre st&#xE4;der. Broarna ligger utmed viktiga transportv&#xE4;gar i regionen.</narrative>
  </description>
